sections.body:
先向前遍历，列出起点真正能到达的状态，并保存到达它们的最短动作序列。然后把边反过来，从可达结局开始找前驱：被标记的状态都有一条完成路径。可达但未被标记的状态，就是本合同下的软锁。

保存为 quest-audit.mjs，运行 node quest-audit.mjs，无额外依赖。输入是已经人工展开的小型显式状态图，不解析自然语言或任意 ink 脚本。代码检查目标存在、同状态动作名唯一、结局没有后续边；只保存玩具规模的完整路径，不是大型剧情分析器。

```javascript
/**
 * @file Find reachable quest states with no path to an approved ending.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-21
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-21
 */

/** @param {object} graph State IDs mapped to [action, nextState] edges.
 * @param {string} start Initial state. @param {string[]} endings Approved terminal IDs.
 * @returns {object} Reachability counts and shortest paths into trapped states. */
export function audit(graph, start, endings) {
  const ids = Object.keys(graph), known = new Set(ids), goals = new Set(endings);
  if (!known.has(start) || goals.size === 0 ||
      [...goals].some(id => !known.has(id))) throw new Error('Invalid endpoints');
  for (const id of ids) {
    const edges = graph[id], actions = new Set();
    if (!Array.isArray(edges) || (goals.has(id) && edges.length)) {
      throw new Error('Invalid terminal or edge list');
    }
    for (const edge of edges) {
      if (!Array.isArray(edge) || edge.length !== 2 ||
          typeof edge[0] !== 'string' || !edge[0] ||
          actions.has(edge[0]) || !known.has(edge[1])) throw new Error('Invalid edge');
      actions.add(edge[0]);
    }
  }
  const queue = [start], paths = new Map([[start, []]]);
  for (let i = 0; i < queue.length; i++) {
    const from = queue[i];
    for (const [action, to] of graph[from]) if (!paths.has(to)) {
      paths.set(to, [...paths.get(from), action]); queue.push(to);
    }
  }
  const parents = new Map(queue.map(id => [id, []]));
  for (const from of queue) for (const [, to] of graph[from]) parents.get(to).push(from);
  const reverse = queue.filter(id => goals.has(id)), canFinish = new Set(reverse);
  for (let i = 0; i < reverse.length; i++) {
    for (const from of parents.get(reverse[i])) if (!canFinish.has(from)) {
      canFinish.add(from); reverse.push(from);
    }
  }
  return {
    reachable: queue.length,
    edges: queue.reduce((n, id) => n + graph[id].length, 0),
    nonterminalDeadEnds: queue.filter(id => !goals.has(id) && !graph[id].length).length,
    canFinishFromStart: canFinish.has(start),
    trapped: queue.filter(id => !canFinish.has(id)).map(state => ({state, path: paths.get(state)})),
  };
}

export const broken = {
  'town:held': [['walk', 'gate:held'], ['store', 'town:stored']],
  'gate:held': [['return', 'town:held'], ['deliver', 'delivered']],
  'town:stored': [['walk', 'gate:stored']],
  'gate:stored': [['return', 'town:stored']],
  delivered: [],
};
export const repaired = {
  ...broken,
  'town:stored': [...broken['town:stored'], ['retrieve', 'town:held']],
};
for (const [name, graph] of [['broken', broken], ['repaired', repaired]]) {
  console.log(JSON.stringify({name, ...audit(graph, 'town:held', ['delivered'])}));
}
```

paths 按完整状态去重，循环往返不会让遍历无限运行；广度优先的首次路径按动作次数最短。反向标记检查的是“还存在一种走法”，不会替玩家选择路线，也不会强迫玩家停止闲逛。
